cache/
# Tracked: settings.json, messages/, README.md, .meta.json. The latter two are
`paraglide-js init` boilerplate but MUST be tracked: the SDK regenerates a
template .gitignore (`*` + `!settings.json`) when it finds them missing,
which would clobber this file and hide new message files from git.
# cache/ holds downloaded plugin bundles (ephemeral).
